---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="旅行 - 风.物">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/jiange/fengwu" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline mb-8 inline-block flex items-center gap-1">← 返回风.物</a>
      
      <header class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-emerald-400">旅行</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">脚步丈量世界，内心感受旅程。</p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">大理古城慢时光</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4">没有行程，只有发呆。洱海边的下午茶，崇圣寺三塔的晨钟，洋人街的烟火气。</p>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">2026-08-20</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
